{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The world's\u00a0fount&quot; is the birthplace of every being in a land\u00a0known as &quot;Ispiral&quot;. One day, a silly and colorful creature is born from this place; his name is Zirri. During his first steps into this world, Zirri will witness a calamitous event: a giant straw descending from the sky and sucking away  the fount's miraculous liquid! Follow Zirri on a journey to find out what's going on, while Ispiral's inhabitants start arguing over the mysterious theft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based RPG with mixed art styles awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Meet characters of any possible kind, if nobody suits your tastes, you might as well have transcended humanity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Visit surreal worlds in search of a place that can feel like home (and a very unusual one at that)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Battle menacing foes (very serious stuff such as a big worm or a gangster eggplant)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Engage in unbalanced and frustrating puzzles, perfect for bragging rights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Experience a very stupid story that will make you cry for no apparent reason</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087140?t=1760052306","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087140?t=1760052306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087140/f48993d1143ba1183956ea471df8cc6ef5472e5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760052306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087140/f48993d1143ba1183956ea471df8cc6ef5472e5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760052306","categories":[{"descrip